START
Read number of points
Read coordinates

Create empty hull set

FOR every pair of points P and Q
    Set positive = false
    Set negative = false

    FOR every other point R
        Calculate cross product

        IF cross product > 0
            Set positive = true
        ELSE IF cross product < 0
            Set negative = true
        END IF
    END FOR

    IF positive and negative are not both true
        Add P and Q to hull set
    END IF
END FOR

Remove duplicate hull points
Calculate centre of hull points
Sort hull points by angle around centre

Display hull boundary
STOP
